WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:07.569
Open "Quote" in the project.

2
00:00:08.069 --> 00:00:13.769
Choose "Template per trade" or add lines from your list.

3
00:00:14.269 --> 00:00:26.598
Lines with a measurement update automatically.

4
00:00:27.098 --> 00:00:32.977
Set the discount and VAT correctly.

5
00:00:33.477 --> 00:00:41.532
Send the quote as a PDF or email it to the client.

6
00:00:42.032 --> 00:00:48.338
The client can approve online.

